{"type":"text","timestamp":1790401815259,"sessionID":"ses_f23bd90e2ffeVy0lkI25m2RFzt","part":{"id":"prt_0dc43a2be001z81crKxiF3pnm7","messageID":"msg_0dc4348eb001pPb45Z5MObBz30","sessionID":"ses_f23bd90e2ffeVy0lkI25m2RFzt","type":"text","text":"The project is intentionally minimal: `BattleUnit` already uses team body layers, the main scene supplies the required `security_drones` and `intruders` groups, and there are no existing custom-node scripts to preserve. I’m wiring the detection layer/mask contract directly into the scene and keeping setters ready for both editor assignment and runtime stats assignment.","time":{"start":1790401815230,"end":1790401815233},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_023c2daa8157ebcb016ab75d0f51788194974197364d4e6714","phase":"commentary"}}}}
