{"type":"text","timestamp":1790402084732,"sessionID":"ses_f23bd90e2ffeVy0lkI25m2RFzt","part":{"id":"prt_0dc47bf5f001hJAwUbX6kPJquB","messageID":"msg_0dc464365001UthBo3nu5CXy2H","sessionID":"ses_f23bd90e2ffeVy0lkI25m2RFzt","type":"text","text":"The corrected project now starts cleanly headlessly with no parse or runtime errors. The movie-maker path itself crashes inside Godot’s dummy renderer because this scene has no visual textures, so I’m using a focused runtime assertion script to verify the actual collision range, group lookup, nearest target, and in-range tracking behavior.","time":{"start":1790402084703,"end":1790402084705},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_023c2daa8157ebcb016ab75e1509f88194a448bae7c4eb6abe","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790402084732,"sessionID":"ses_f23bd90e2ffeVy0lkI25m2RFzt","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_hlL6ryKu22W5DYMGWUuVTmBz","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd\n+extends Node\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tvar main := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\tget_tree().root.add_child(main)\n+\tawait get_tree().physics_frame\n+\n+\tvar drone: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"DroneUnit\")\n+\tvar close_intruder: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"IntruderClose\")\n+\tvar distant_intruder: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"IntruderDistant\")\n+\tvar finder := drone.target_finder\n+\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.collision_layer == 4)\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.collision_mask == 2)\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.col_shape.shape.radius == 72.0)\n+\tassert(finder.has_target_in_range())\n+\tfinder.find_target()\n+\tassert(finder.target == close_intruder)\n+\tassert(distant_intruder not in finder.targets_in_range)\n+\n+\tprint(\"Targeting verification passed\")\n+\tget_tree().quit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd\n+++ /workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@\n+extends Node\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tvar main := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\tget_tree().root.add_child(main)\n+\tawait get_tree().physics_frame\n+\n+\tvar drone: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"DroneUnit\")\n+\tvar close_intruder: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"IntruderClose\")\n+\tvar distant_intruder: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"IntruderDistant\")\n+\tvar finder := drone.target_finder\n+\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.collision_layer == 4)\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.collision_mask == 2)\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.col_shape.shape.radius == 72.0)\n+\tassert(finder.has_target_in_range())\n+\tfinder.find_target()\n+\tassert(finder.target == close_intruder)\n+\tassert(distant_intruder not in finder.targets_in_range)\n+\n+\tprint(\"Targeting verification passed\")\n+\tget_tree().quit()\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd","relativePath":"workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd","type":"add","patch":"Index: /workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd\n+++ /workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@\n+extends Node\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tvar main := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\tget_tree().root.add_child(main)\n+\tawait get_tree().physics_frame\n+\n+\tvar drone: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"DroneUnit\")\n+\tvar close_intruder: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"IntruderClose\")\n+\tvar distant_intruder: BattleUnit = main.get_node(\"IntruderDistant\")\n+\tvar finder := drone.target_finder\n+\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.collision_layer == 4)\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.collision_mask == 2)\n+\tassert(drone.detect_range.col_shape.shape.radius == 72.0)\n+\tassert(finder.has_target_in_range())\n+\tfinder.find_target()\n+\tassert(finder.target == close_intruder)\n+\tassert(distant_intruder not in finder.targets_in_range)\n+\n+\tprint(\"Targeting verification passed\")\n+\tget_tree().quit()\n","additions":23,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/scripts/verify_targeting.gd","time":{"start":1790402084712,"end":1790402084716}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_023c2daa8157ebcb016ab75e19c7e08194bfc6ca2e389496bc"}},"id":"prt_0dc47bf630013MH40QWyI6YlV8","sessionID":"ses_f23bd90e2ffeVy0lkI25m2RFzt","messageID":"msg_0dc464365001UthBo3nu5CXy2H"}}
